00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.740
at a Sunday evening
and tomorrow on Monday,

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.840
we have a workshop with a
very important client of ours,

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:11.740
a client of Building Radar,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:13.883
the company that I currently work for.

00:00:13.883 --> 00:00:15.344
Here next to me is Leopold

00:00:15.344 --> 00:00:18.740
another colleague of mine
also at Building Radar.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.150
And in this video, I decided
to show you three things,

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:23.480
three things that we do.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.770
The first, you can just
